<div class="container">

<div class="field field-cards cards field--items">
            <div class="card">
      <div class="card-inner">
        <div class="front">
                                                                                                                    <div class="photo-object" style="background-image: url(/sites/default/files/styles/card/public/2020-02/card-degrees.jpg?itok=fsoo2Arz);"><span class="sr-only"></span></div>
                                                            <div class="card-label">Earn a Degree or Certificate</div>
        </div>

        <div class="back">
                            <div class='card-title'>Earn a Degree or Certificate</div>
                            <p>IECC offers a wide range of degree and certificate programs that provide varied choices in pursuit of a career and technical education (CTE) or as a pathway to a four-year institution.&nbsp;</p>


                            <div class="action">
              <a class='call-to-action' href='/iecc/academics/areas-study'>View Our Areas of Study</a>
              </div>
                            
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
            <div class="card">
      <div class="card-inner">
        <div class="front">
                                                                                                                    <div class="photo-object" style="background-image: url(/sites/default/files/styles/card/public/2020-02/frontier%402x_0.jpg?itok=8D3SEtAA);"><span class="sr-only"></span></div>
                                                            <div class="card-label">Visit Our Colleges</div>
        </div>

        <div class="back">
                            <div class='card-title'>Visit Our Colleges</div>
                            <p>We're proud of our campuses and would love to show you why! Please join us for a Campus Visit by selecting a college below for more information and to setup a time that works for your schedule.</p>

<ul>
	<li><a href="/node/264" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Frontier Community College</a></li>
	<li><a href="/node/345" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Lincoln Trail College</a></li>
	<li><a href="/node/102" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Olney Central College</a></li>
	<li><a href="/node/298" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Wabash Valley College</a></li>
</ul>


              
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
            <div class="card">
      <div class="card-inner">
        <div class="front">
                                                                                                                    <div class="photo-object" style="background-image: url(/sites/default/files/styles/card/public/2020-02/card-skills.jpg?itok=aahS3J6c);"><span class="sr-only"></span></div>
                                                            <div class="card-label">Develop Professional Skills</div>
        </div>

        <div class="back">
                            <div class='card-title'>Develop Professional Skills</div>
                            <p>IECC's Business &amp; Industry programs provide training and educational opportunities for individuals seeking increased career advancement potential or wanting a new career, as well as displaced workers, and employers seeking a competitive edge.</p>


                            <div class="action">
              <a class='call-to-action' href='/businessandindustry'>Learn About Business &amp; Industry</a>
              </div>
                            
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
            <div class="card">
      <div class="card-inner">
        <div class="front">
                                                                                                                    <div class="photo-object" style="background-image: url(/sites/default/files/styles/card/public/2020-05/student_taking_notes.jpg?itok=Md9gw01B);"><span class="sr-only"></span></div>
                                                            <div class="card-label">Take a Class or Two</div>
        </div>

        <div class="back">
                            <div class='card-title'>Take a Class or Two</div>
                            <p>Aren't ready to join as a full-time student? Are you interested in just taking just one class?&nbsp;We offer the option of taking just one or two classes to meet the schedules and needs of a wide variety of students.</p>


                            <div class="action">
              <a class='call-to-action' href='https://www.iecc.edu/schedules'>Search Course Schedules</a>
              </div>
                            
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
            <div class="card">
      <div class="card-inner">
        <div class="front">
                                                                                                                    <div class="photo-object" style="background-image: url(/sites/default/files/styles/card/public/2020-05/person_holding_grinder.jpg?itok=OkQQTeW7);"><span class="sr-only"></span></div>
                                                            <div class="card-label">Train for a New Career</div>
        </div>

        <div class="back">
                            <div class='card-title'>Train for a New Career</div>
                            <p>Whether you are starting over or looking for a new career, IECC colleges provide&nbsp;paths to help you jumpstart new job interests and get you back into the working world.</p>


                            <div class="action">
              <a class='call-to-action' href='/apply'>Click Here to Apply</a>
              </div>
                            
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
            <div class="card">
      <div class="card-inner">
        <div class="front">
                                                                                                                    <div class="photo-object" style="background-image: url(/sites/default/files/styles/card/public/2020-02/card-fun.jpg?itok=-266E6UB);"><span class="sr-only"></span></div>
                                                            <div class="card-label">Learn Something New for Fun</div>
