                            <p>Interested in learning something new and fun? Try taking an art class. Join a theater production. Brush up on the Microsoft Suite. Each college offers a variety of courses that any student can take to try a new hobby or learn a new skillset.</p>


                            <div class="action">
              <a class='call-to-action' href='/communityed'>View Our Community Education Options</a>
              </div>
                            
        </div>
